OL,3,GNEWSASmart glasses can be used for
OL,4,Aspeeches in the Senedd, presiding
OL,5,Aofficer says
OL,6,
OL,7,FSmart glasses can be used in the
OL,8,FSenedd's debating chamber, the
OL,9,Fparliament's presiding officer has
OL,10,Fruled, after a Reform member prompted
OL,11,Fdebate by using them to make a speech.
OL,13,FHuw Irranca-Davies, who maintains order
OL,14,Fin the Welsh Parliament as its Speaker,
OL,15,Fsaid the devices could be used as a
OL,16,F"teleprompter" provided he was given
OL,17,Fadvanced notice.
OL,19,FReform Senedd member Jason O'Connell
OL,20,Fsaid he was pleased that the Senedd was
OL,21,F"forward looking" in allowing the
OL,22,Ftechnology.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
